{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-56","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-56"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-talk-403815432-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-56","missionId":"event-rogue-56","mission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","scene":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"쓰레기통을 멘 사람을 만났다. 그는 쭈그려 앉아 자신의 보물인 쓰레기통을 당신에게 보여줬다","talkId":403815432,"textHash":"12847355544722775761","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:56/talk-403815432","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e962ea4ef42356f5","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-talk-403815433-line"],"bwikiPage":"掏垃圾桶大师","bwikiRevision":92650,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10322","bwikiMission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-talk-403815433-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-56","missionId":"event-rogue-56","mission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","scene":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「이건 신비로운 공간이야」 그는 손을 흔들곤 당신에게 공간을 내주기 위해 애절한 사랑 시를 꺼내서 버렸다","talkId":403815433,"textHash":"8028487459137968342","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:56/talk-403815433","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e962ea4ef42356f5","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-talk-403815434-line"],"bwikiPage":"掏垃圾桶大师","bwikiRevision":92650,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10322","bwikiMission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-talk-403815434-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-56","missionId":"event-rogue-56","mission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","scene":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그가 나지막이 말했다. 「너의 쓰레기를 안에 넣으면, 의식을 가진 물건으로 진화해 스스로 활기차게 뛰쳐나올 거야!」","talkId":403815434,"textHash":"2426756897108553866","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:56/talk-403815434","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e962ea4ef42356f5","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"掏垃圾桶大师","bwikiRevision":92650,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10322","bwikiMission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-text-722388138374174098-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-56","missionId":"event-rogue-56","mission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","scene":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"당신은 버려진 물건들의 전생을 떠올린다","talkId":null,"textHash":"722388138374174098","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:56/text-722388138374174098","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c106b4a385856905","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-text-17114457710524011732-effect"],"bwikiPage":"掏垃圾桶大师","bwikiRevision":92650,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10322","bwikiMission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-text-17114457710524011732-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-56","missionId":"event-rogue-56","mission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","scene":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"랜덤 기물 1개를 버리고 기물 2개를 획득한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"17114457710524011732","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:56/text-17114457710524011732","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c106b4a385856905","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"掏垃圾桶大师","bwikiRevision":92650,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10322","bwikiMission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-text-722388138374174098-choice"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-text-16376933470002432117-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-56","missionId":"event-rogue-56","mission":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","scene":"쓰레기통 털기 마스터","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"방심한 틈에 얼른 훔친다!","talkId":null,"textHash":"16376933470002432117","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:56/text-16376933470002432117","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"dc9f8af666f94d92","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-text-8323497576813601097-effect"],"bwikiPage":"掏垃圾桶大师","bw